# Edit this file to add satellites
# Each line is a group of satellites
#
# Format :
# Group Name;local_filename;url
# * Group Name : This is the name of the group which will be used in KStars
# * local_filename : This is the name of the file used to store the orbital elements
# * url : The url where the orbital elements can be retrieved (you can leave this field blank, in this case, KStars will not update the file)
#
# Orbital elements can be in TLE format or in OMM JSON format (FORMAT=json on CelesTrak). The format is detected
# from the content of the file. Prefer OMM JSON: TLE cannot hold catalog numbers above 99999, so CelesTrak
# leaves newer objects out of TLE data.
#
Last Launches;new.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=last-30-days&FORMAT=json
International Space Station;iss.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=stations&FORMAT=json
Brightest;visual.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=visual&FORMAT=json
#FENGYUN 1C Debris;fengyun-1c-debris.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=1999-025&FORMAT=json
#IRIDIUM 33 Debris;iridium-33-debris.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=iridium-33-debris&FORMAT=json
#COSMOS 2251 Debris;cosmos-2251-debris.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=cosmos-2251-debris&FORMAT=json
Weather;weather.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=weather&FORMAT=json
GOES;goes.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=goes&FORMAT=json
Earth Resources;resource.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=resource&FORMAT=json
Search & Rescue (SARSAT);sarsat.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=sarsat&FORMAT=json
Disaster Monitoring;dmc.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=dmc&FORMAT=json
Tracking and Data Relay Satellite System (TDRSS);tdrss.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=tdrss&FORMAT=json
Geostationary;geo.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=geo&FORMAT=json
Intelsat;intelsat.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=intelsat&FORMAT=json
Iridium NEXT;iridium-NEXT.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=iridium-NEXT&FORMAT=json
Orbcomm;orbcomm.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=orbcomm&FORMAT=json
Globalstar;globalstar.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=globalstar&FORMAT=json
Amateur Radio;amateur.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=amateur&FORMAT=json
Experimental;x-comm.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=x-comm&FORMAT=json
Other;other-comm.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=other-comm&FORMAT=json
GPS Operational;gps-ops.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=gps-ops&FORMAT=json
Glonass Operational;glo-ops.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=glo-ops&FORMAT=json
Galileo;galileo.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=galileo&FORMAT=json
Satellite-Based Augmentation System (WAAS/EGNOS/MSAS);sbas.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=sbas&FORMAT=json
Navy Navigation Satellite System (NNSS);nnss.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=nnss&FORMAT=json
Russian LEO Navigation;musson.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=musson&FORMAT=json
Space & Earth Science;science.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=science&FORMAT=json
Geodetic;geodetic.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=geodetic&FORMAT=json
Engineering;engineering.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=engineering&FORMAT=json
Education;education.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=education&FORMAT=json
Miscellaneous Military;military.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=military&FORMAT=json
Radar Calibration;radar.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=radar&FORMAT=json
CubeSats;cubesats.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=cubesat&FORMAT=json
Supplemental GPS;gps.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/supplemental/sup-gp.php?FILE=gps&FORMAT=json
Supplemental GLONASS;glonass.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/supplemental/sup-gp.php?FILE=glonass&FORMAT=json
Supplemental METEOSAT;meteosat.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=meteosat&FORMAT=json
Supplemental INTELSAT;intelsat.tle;http://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/supplemental/sup-gp.php?FILE=intelsat&FORMAT=json
